<view class="page profile-page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="brand">花屿叶</view>
    <view class="slogan">一屿花开，一叶知心</view>
  </view>

  <view class="wallet-entry" bindtap="goWallet">
    <view>
      <view class="wallet-label">账户余额</view>
      <view class="wallet-balance"><text class="yen">¥</text>{{balance}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="wallet-cta">去充值</view>
  </view>

  <view class="menu">
    <view class="menu-item" bindtap="goOrders">我的订单</view>
    <view class="menu-item" bindtap="goAddresses">收货地址</view>
    <view class="menu-item" bindtap="goWallet">余额充值</view>
    <view class="menu-item" bindtap="goCart">购物车</view>
    <view class="menu-item" bindtap="goCategory">继续选花</view>
  </view>

  <view class="shop-card">
    <view class="shop-title">店铺地址</view>
    <view class="shop-name">{{shop.name}}</view>
    <view class="muted">{{shop.address}}</view>
    <view class="muted">{{shop.businessHours}}</view>
    <view class="shop-phone" bindtap="callShop">电话 {{shop.phone}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="tips muted">
    当前为测试号联调版本：支付/充值为模拟，数据保存在本地后端内存中。买花时可选择外卖配送或到店自取。
  </view>
</view>
